    "information": {
      "description": "<p><em>Compact Groundcar.</em> Upgrades: TUp (MetalGear Coating [+3 SP]) Armored Chassis, Autopilot Terminal, Bulletproof Glass [x2], Bulwark Armor, Communications Center, CrystalDome, Heavy Chassis, Improved Engine, Sealed Environment, Smuggling Upgrade [x4], TUp (Automated) Vehicle Heavy Weapon Mount (w/ Remote Weapon System &amp; Militech Mk. 31 HMG). Stock, the back carries 5 tons and 10 more riders who can't operate anything. Its weapon mount is a self-firing turret (like an Automated Turret) that shoots any threat; the driver or front passenger raises or lowers it as an Action (lowered, hidden and off), and a front passenger can fire it by hand.</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> 101,000eb<br><strong>Nomad:</strong> 10<br><strong>SDP:</strong> 80<br><strong>SP:</strong> 18<br><strong>MOVE:</strong> 20<br><strong>Speed:</strong> 125 mph</p><p><small>Item Compendium (2070) • Vehicles</small></p>",
